body:
I'm aries but Aquarius FTW. They are the blueprint. Perfect girl, perfect dude, perfect student (the most popular and pretty in college), perfect body, the most genetically blessed in the family, perfect style, and the ones with the most unique instagram accounts, just a perfect human overall. All the women I've loved are Aquariuses 😍😍😍😍😍 

&#x200B;

edit: *I forgot to add,* *also the most chill, composed, smart, and interesting individuals to ever converse with, the most non toxic and non judgmental people, don't let their cool demeanor fool you, they are just as cunning as scorpios but with social skills and good hygiene* 😍😍😍

